&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is for people who believe&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;trust is paramount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;transformation is embraced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;the future is here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;because&lt;strong&gt; &quot;What we do matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;!&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;We are a next generation solutions provider, delivering mission success across government, healthcare, and commercial industries. Iron Bow relies on our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;passionate people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;long standing partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to solve your most critical challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether we team with clients, colleagues, or partners, we put each other first. It’s &lt;strong&gt;The&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Iron Bow Way.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;THE HIGH LEVEL&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;proven IT enterprise sales leader&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with a consistent track record of generating &lt;strong&gt;$2M+ is annual gross profit &lt;/strong&gt;who knows how to build trusted executive relationships, uncover complex business challenges, and turn them into meaningful growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Account Manager, Commercial Enterprise&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll own and grow strategic enterprise accounts while pursuing high value new opportunities and expanding Iron Bow’s footprint across the commercial market.&amp;nbsp; This is an opportunity for an accomplished seller who brings strong customer relationships, a history of delivering significant gross profit, and the ability to navigate complex enterprise environments.&amp;nbsp; You’ll have the breadth of Iron Bow’s technology portfolio, engineering expertise, services capabilities, and strategic OEM partnerships behind you – giving you the resources to solve complex customer challenges and build long-term profitable relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;HOW YOU’LL MAKE AN IMPACT&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own, develop and grow strategic enterprise customer relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to executive and technology leaders, aligning solutions to their desired outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans that drive profitable growth, expansion and net-new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify whitespace withing existing accounts and build relationships across new buying centers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursue and develop new enterprise customers and strategic opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver integrated technology solutions and professional services across &lt;strong&gt;networking, data center &amp;amp; cloud, collaboration &amp;amp; workplace innovation, cybersecurity, and data &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex enterprise pursuits from opportunity identification through solution development and close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering, CTO, Service Delivery, Marketing and Strategic Alliances to develop differentiated customer solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage your strong relationships with OEM and technology partners to expand relevance and influence within your accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong pipeline and consistently deliver against revenue and gross profit objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;SKILLS THAT DRIVE SUCCESS&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success selling complex technology solutions and services into large commercial enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consistent track record of generating &lt;strong&gt;$2M+ is annual gross profit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage and grow revenues within existing strategic accounts while developing net-new account business relationships and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience successfully selling across multiple solution architectural areas such as: Networking, Cybersecurity, Collaboration &amp;amp; Workspace Innovation, Data Center &amp;amp; Cloud, AI &amp;amp; Data, and professional or manages services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to navigate complex enterprise sales cycles and lead extended account teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong existing relationships with OEM and technology partners and the ability to leverage those them to create quantifiable customer value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling and managing complex professional services engagements, including advisory, integration and managed services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with ability to align technology investments to measurable business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A creative, consultative and entrepreneurial sales approach with the ability to identify opportunities and turn them into sustainable growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and demonstrated ability to bring internal teams, partners, and customers together to deliver successful outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;TRAVEL REQUIREMENTS&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position prefers candidates based in &lt;strong&gt;Washington, DC, Herndon, VA, New York, Charlotte, Atlanta or Philadelphia areas&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and requires 30-50% travel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;WHY YOU’LL LOVE IT!&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Platform to Win: &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll have the strength of Iron Bow’s Engineering, CTO Office, Inside Sales, Service Delivery, Customer Success, Strategic Alliances, and Marketing teams behind you, along with relationships across leading technology partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Access &amp;amp; Impact: &lt;/strong&gt;Build meaningful relationships with senior decision makers and help solve complex, high-value enterprise challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Room to Grow: &lt;/strong&gt;Expand strategic account, pursue whitespace, develop new customers, and create opportunities across a broad technology and services portfolio. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Support: &lt;/strong&gt;We trust experienced sellers to lead their business while providing the technical expertise, resources, and leadership support needed to succeed. We work hard and play hard—creating a space where innovation thrives, ideas are valued, growth is encouraged, and wins are celebrated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uncapped Earning Potential: Best&lt;/strong&gt; of all, your success is rewarded. Our compensation plans are designed to recognize growth, performance, and the impact you make.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Compensation and Benefit Information:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The initial annual base salary range for this position is $120,000 - $150,000.&amp;nbsp; In addition to base salary, this role offers a competitive on-target earnings (OTE) structure, with strong upside potential tied to individual performance. Our compensation plans are designed to reward success, drive growth, and recognize the impact our sales teams make in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-MA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR EQUAL OPPORTUNITY EMPLOYER COMMITMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to the principle of equal employment opportunity for all employees and to providing employees with a work environment free of discrimination and harassment.&amp;nbsp; All employment decisions at Iron Bow are based on relevant business considerations, such as operational needs, job requirements and individual qualifications, without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or gender expression, pregnancy, national origin, age, disability, status as a protected veteran or any other characteristic prohibited by law.&amp;nbsp;Iron Bow will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is for people who believe&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;trust is paramount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;transformation is embraced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;the future is here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;because&lt;strong&gt; &quot;What we do matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;!&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;We are a next generation solutions provider, delivering mission success across government, healthcare, and commercial industries. Iron Bow relies on our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;passionate people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;long standing partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to solve your most critical challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether we team with clients, colleagues, or partners, we put each other first. It’s &lt;strong&gt;The&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Iron Bow Way.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;THE HIGH LEVEL&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Iron Bow, our Account Managers, SLED aren’t just visionary leaders; they’re the architect of client success.&amp;nbsp; They stand at the forefront of innovation, collaborating with strategic partners and internal teams to sculpt tailored solutions.&amp;nbsp; With a keen eye for understanding client missions and a mastery of cutting-edge technology, our Account Managers, SLED transform challenges into opportunities, navigating the dynamic landscape of IT with strategic prowess and empathetic understanding.&amp;nbsp; Our Account Managers, SLED have a passion to grow, possess positive energy and a commitment to win!&amp;nbsp; &lt;em&gt;**This position will be based in Texas (preferred locations: Austin, Dallas-Ft. Worth or Houston). &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;WHAT SUCCESS LOOKS LIKE?&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Visionary:&lt;/strong&gt; As the quarterback of large-scale opportunities within highly intricate landscape of our SLED accounts, you’re the trailblazer who shapes success through a proven track record of domain command.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Builder:&lt;/strong&gt; Results are your forte. You not only comprehend but thrive in understanding the pivotal role of IT within your clients&#39; worlds. Your drive lies in achieving program initiatives amidst the ever-evolving dynamics of customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptive Problem-Solver: &lt;/strong&gt;Swiftly address customer pain points with innovative solutions, adapting seamlessly to evolving needs and dynamic market changes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Outcome Seller:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re not just selling IT solutions; you&#39;re shaping the future, adept at showcasing how our offerings translate into tangible business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Expert:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of SLED customers, isn&#39;t just a skill; it&#39;s your superpower.&amp;nbsp; Your insights of market nuances, customer needs, and the ever-shifting business landscapes pave the way for tailored, impactful solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQ-Infused Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re a force driven by emotional intelligence, believing that empathy, intuition, and strong leadership set the tone for triumph and results-oriented success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BE DOING&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll concentrate on consultative IT sales focused on providing customer driven outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll oversee sales and professional service solutions tailored to our core capabilities within large, complex SLED accounts specific region with a primary focus on Networking, Cybersecurity, Collaboration &amp;amp; Workspace Innovation, Data Center &amp;amp; Cloud, and AI &amp;amp; Data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering and business development teams to expand account territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all aspects of the customer relationship and an excellent knowledge of their customers’ missions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and executing strategic growth plans to drive product and professional services business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining strong relationships with vendors and OEM counterparts, leveraging these relationships within SLED market for success. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving mission success and growth by fostering strategic relationships with new and existing clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging business and community relationships to increase business revenue through information technology solutions sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;YOUR VALUE PROP FOR OUR TEAM&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent and proven track record in understanding customer needs within SLED accounts, operating with meticulous attention to detail, urgency, and a passion for driving transformational business outcomes. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vital experience in SLED (State, Local and Education), with 8+ years of experience in selling technology solutions aligned with Iron Bow’s core capabilities: Networking, Cybersecurity, Collaboration &amp;amp; Workspace Innovation, Data Center &amp;amp; Cloud, and AI &amp;amp; Data. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An out of the box thinker, who enjoys problem solving and with a consultative approach to driving cutting-edge technologies. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Masterful at prioritizing tasks to consistently deliver results within tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a dynamic, fast-paced environment, embracing challenges as opportunities for rapid learning and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inspirational team player who embodies leadership qualities, fostering collaboration and enhancing team performance with a winning attitude. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;TRAVEL REQUIREMENTS&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position prefers candidates based in Texas (&lt;em&gt;Austin, Dallas-Ft. Worth or Houston) &lt;/em&gt;and requires 30% travel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;WHY YOU’LL LOVE IT!&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Environment -&lt;/strong&gt; Collaboration isn’t a buzzword, it&#39;s the key to our success. You’ll seamlessly collaborate with our Engineering, Chief Technology Office, Chief Strategy Office, Sales and Marketing teams for precise alignment and propelling opportunities towards excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity –&lt;/strong&gt; Ethical standards are non-negotiable at Iron Bow. Upholding honesty and authenticity in every client interaction cements our reputation as a trustworthy partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformation –&lt;/strong&gt; Join us in redesigning the customer and employee experience, for unparalleled success. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thriving Culture – &lt;/strong&gt;Our company culture isn’t just about work; it’s about promoting an environment where innovation flourishes, ideas are heard, and growth is supported. We value diversity, creativity, and foster an atmosphere that fuels your professional journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impactful Work - &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll be part of meaningful projects that make a difference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Excellence - &lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re at the forefront of our industry, pushing boundaries and forward-thinking initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Autonomy - &lt;/strong&gt;We encourage our team members to excel and make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resources - &lt;/strong&gt;Access the tools and support needed to succeed; we’re heavily invested!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rewards, Recognition &amp;amp; Exceptional Leadership - &lt;/strong&gt;Best of all, our compensation plans are designed to reward &amp;amp; motivate - The sky’s the limit! And our leaders are there to provide expert guidance for your growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Compensation and Benefit Information:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The initial base salary range for this position is up to $140,000&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;In addition to base salary, this role offers a &lt;strong&gt;competitive on-target earnings (OTE) structure, with strong upside potential tied to individual performance&lt;/strong&gt;. Our compensation plans are designed to reward success, drive growth, and recognize the impact our sales teams make in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Iron Bow, we invest in our people and their success. We offer a comprehensive benefits package that may include medical, dental, and vision coverage, a 401(k) plan, paid time off, and additional wellness and financial benefits. An overview of our benefits is available on our careers page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-MA1 #LI-TX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR EQUAL OPPORTUNITY EMPLOYER COMMITMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to the principle of equal employment opportunity for all employees and to providing employees with a work environment free of discrimination and harassment.&amp;nbsp; All employment decisions at Iron Bow are based on relevant business considerations, such as operational needs, job requirements and individual qualifications, without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or gender expression, pregnancy, national origin, age, disability, status as a protected veteran or any other characteristic prohibited by law.&amp;nbsp;Iron Bow will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is for people who believe&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;trust is paramount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;transformation is embraced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;the future is here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;because&lt;strong&gt; &quot;What we do matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;!&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;We are a next generation solutions provider, delivering mission success across government, healthcare, and commercial industries. Iron Bow relies on our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;passionate people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;long standing partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to solve your most critical challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether we team with clients, colleagues, or partners, we put each other first. It’s &lt;strong&gt;The&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Iron Bow Way.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Iron Bow’s five-person service desk team supporting approximately 800 employees, where you’ll combine hands-on technical support with account administration, workstation deployment, and opportunities to develop your systems administration skills. You’ll help employees stay productive while expanding your knowledge through practical experience and collaboration with our systems and network teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW YOU&#39;LL MAKE AN IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of employee support requests received through walk-ins, phone, email, and the ServiceNow portal, keeping users informed from initial contact through resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot Windows 11, Microsoft 365 applications, BitLocker, workstation hardware, peripherals, and everyday business applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve initial requests and basic escalations, partnering with systems and network teams on more complex issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage employee account onboarding, changes, and offboarding across Active Directory, Microsoft Entra ID, Microsoft 365, Exchange Online, and Okta.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and image workstations using Windows Deployment Services, ensuring equipment is ready for employees to use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver technical onboarding, orientation, and training that help new employees get started confidently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate hardware inventory and asset records throughout equipment assignment, reassignment, and retirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support mobile devices and macOS systems, building familiarity with Microsoft Intune and Jamf for device management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot remote connectivity through Palo Alto GlobalProtect and help employees use Webex conferencing and collaboration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document solutions and support procedures, contribute improvements, and learn to maintain PowerShell scripts used for account provisioning and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;SKILLS THAT DRIVE SUCCESS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least two years of relevant service desk, desktop support, or IT support experience; this role is particularly suited to someone with two to five years of experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable troubleshooting Windows workstations, Microsoft Office and Microsoft 365 applications, hardware, and peripherals, with working knowledge of Windows 11 and BitLocker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with employee account support and understand the importance of accurate, timely onboarding and offboarding. Familiarity with Active Directory, Entra ID, Microsoft 365, Exchange Online, or Okta is valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring experience with ServiceNow or a comparable ticketing platform and keep clear records of issues, troubleshooting steps, and resolutions. ServiceNow experience is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have familiarity with workstation imaging, deployment, and IT asset management; experience with Windows Deployment Services is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly, listen carefully, and explain technical issues in a way that helps employees feel informed and supported.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take ownership, follow through on commitments, and use initiative while knowing when to ask questions or involve a teammate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy working as part of a team, sharing what you learn, and collaborating with specialists to solve problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about technologies you haven’t used yet. Familiarity with macOS, mobile device management, VPNs, or video conferencing is helpful; you can build skills with Intune, Jamf, GlobalProtect, and Webex on the job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT SETS &lt;em&gt;YOU&lt;/em&gt; APART&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relevant degree or IT certification is preferred. PowerShell or other scripting knowledge is a strong bonus, and a willingness to learn is welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;WHY YOU&#39;LL LOVE IT!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build skills that take your IT career further.&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll gain hands-on experience across identity platforms, endpoint management, account administration, and automation, with encouragement to stretch your abilities and learn new systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with people you can learn from.&lt;/strong&gt;On a five-person service desk supporting approximately 800 employees, you’ll have opportunities to contribute, share ideas, and work alongside systems and network specialists on challenges that broaden your experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;See the difference your work makes.&lt;/strong&gt;From giving a new employee a smooth first day to resolving an issue that gets someone back to work, your contributions will have a direct, visible impact across Iron Bow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enjoy a predictable schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;This permanent, full-time role offers regular daytime hours with no evening, weekend, or on-call expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFIT INFORMATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this position is $28.00 - $30.00/hr. This range reflects the anticipated base pay for the position and is not a guarantee of final compensation. Actual compensation will be determined based on factors including experience, skills, education, location, contract requirements, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iron Bow Technologies reserves the right to fill this role at a different level, depending on qualifications and organizational priorities. This range represents only one component of Iron Bow’s total compensation package. An overview of our benefits is available on our careers page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR EQUAL OPPORTUNITY EMPLOYER COMMITMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to the principle of equal employment opportunity for all employees and to providing employees with a work environment free of discrimination and harassment.&amp;nbsp; All employment decisions at Iron Bow are based on relevant business considerations, such as operational needs, job requirements and individual qualifications, without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or gender expression, pregnancy, national origin, age, disability, status as a protected veteran or any other characteristic prohibited by law.&amp;nbsp;Iron Bow will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is for people who believe&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;trust is paramount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;transformation is embraced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;the future is here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;because&lt;strong&gt; &quot;What we do matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;!&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;We are a next generation solutions provider, delivering mission success across government, healthcare, and commercial industries. Iron Bow relies on our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;passionate people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;long standing partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to solve your most critical challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether we team with clients, colleagues, or partners, we put each other first. It’s &lt;strong&gt;The&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Iron Bow Way.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE HIGH LEVEL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Iron Bow, our Consulting Systems Engineers (CSEs) are seasoned &lt;em&gt;presales engineering &lt;/em&gt;professionals with a deep passion for technology and commitment to helping customers achieve their business outcomes.&amp;nbsp; As a CSE, you’ll collaborate with our engineering teams to develop innovative and tailored solutions for our clients.&amp;nbsp; This role offers exposure to diverse range of technologies, with continuous opportunities to learn and adapt to new advancements.&amp;nbsp; To excel in this position, you must possess a keen eye for detail, a creative problem-solving mindset, and ability to think outside the box.&amp;nbsp; You should also be able to work with a sense of urgency and have a passion for innovation.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CSEs are integral to Iron Bow’s strategic approach, leveraging their technical expertise and domain knowledge to craft solutions that align with our pillar strategies: IT modernization, Workforce Experience, Digital Transformation and Cybersecurity.&amp;nbsp; CSEs are the backbone of Iron Bow’s offerings, ensuring that each solution is tailored to meet our customers’ unique needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;WHAT SUCCESS LOOKS LIKE?&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Visionary:&lt;/strong&gt; As presales engineer of large-scale opportunities within highly intricate landscape of our customer base&lt;strong&gt;,&lt;/strong&gt; you’re the trailblazer who shapes success of our customers missions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Builder:&lt;/strong&gt; Results are your forte. You not only comprehend but thrive in understanding the pivotal role of IT within your clients&#39; worlds. Your drive lies in achieving program initiatives amidst the ever-evolving dynamics of customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptive Problem-Solver: &lt;/strong&gt;Swiftly address customer pain points with innovative solutions, adapting seamlessly to evolving needs and dynamic market changes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Outcome Seller:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re not just selling IT solutions; you&#39;re shaping the future, adept at showcasing how our offerings translate into tangible business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Expert:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding your customers and their markets isn&#39;t just a skill; it&#39;s your superpower.&amp;nbsp; Your insights of market nuances, customer needs, and the ever-shifting business landscapes pave the way for tailored, impactful solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQ-Infused Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re a force driven by emotional intelligence, believing that empathy, intuition, and strong leadership set the tone for triumph and results-oriented success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BE DOING&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in concert with Account Teams to building consultative relationships and providing IT solutions and professional services to customer base (engagement, program and managed services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on innovative technical presales solutions to include cloud, collaboration, security, data center, networking mobility &amp;amp; end user devices, managed services and digital/IoT transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work as a trusted advisor to provide leadership in knowledge of key products, solutions and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing Proposals and SOWs, assisting account teams in effectively packaging, pricing, and presenting solution to&amp;nbsp;customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead proposal solutioning as the technical solution owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validation and creation of Bills of Materials from leading OEMs using appropriate configuration tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical assistance to customers and Account Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obtain customer integration service needs, challenges and product requirements to develop business cases to drive solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and communicate IT strategy and vision based on Iron Bow’s capabilities to meet your customers’ technical requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;YOUR VALUE PROP FOR OUR TEAM &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A broad understanding of technology and the ability to consult with the customer regarding cloud, collaboration, security, data center, networking mobility &amp;amp; end user devices, managed services and digital/IoT transformation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically requires a Bachelor degree in a related field and 10 years experience in engineering presales or related experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop area of specialization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of solutions to meet customer requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with other lead OEMs, as well as experience with OEM configuration and operation toolsets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of relevant solutions sets, products line specifications, performance criteria and applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, listening, negotiation and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively, add value as a team member, and assume a technical leadership role for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical knowledge and consultative skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant experience in key competitor offerings in technology areas to drive business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a team environment with high performing employees and collaborate with internal technical experts to develop and drive solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US citizenship is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Government clearance is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OEM Certifications are a plus (Dell datacenter ideally)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Department of Justice desired but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;TRAVEL REQUIREMENTS&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote position we prefer candidates based in the National Capital Region or within Mid Atlantic region and may include up to 20% travel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
