&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT SETS &lt;em&gt;YOU&lt;/em&gt; APART&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;eokcae&quot; data-start=&quot;3266&quot; data-end=&quot;3388&quot;&gt;Previous experience working in a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3301&quot; data-end=&quot;3387&quot;&gt;customer-facing help desk, service desk, technical support, or similar environment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;l959r&quot; data-start=&quot;3389&quot; data-end=&quot;3475&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3408&quot; data-end=&quot;3474&quot;&gt;ServiceNow or another IT service management/ticketing platform&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;c5rmzc&quot; data-start=&quot;3476&quot; data-end=&quot;3559&quot;&gt;You genuinely enjoy troubleshooting and figuring out why something isn’t working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vsmzm5&quot; data-start=&quot;3560&quot; data-end=&quot;3706&quot;&gt;You understand that providing great technical support is as much about the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3637&quot; data-end=&quot;3660&quot;&gt;customer experience&lt;/strong&gt; as it is about solving the technical problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10eky1i&quot; data-start=&quot;3707&quot; data-end=&quot;3800&quot;&gt;You take ownership of issues and follow through rather than simply passing a problem along.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kx38kf&quot; data-start=&quot;3801&quot; data-end=&quot;3922&quot;&gt;You are curious, eager to learn, and looking for an opportunity to grow your technical skills and build a career in IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
