&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;3952&quot; data-end=&quot;4209&quot;&gt;At Iron Bow, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3965&quot; data-end=&quot;3987&quot;&gt;What We Do Matters&lt;/strong&gt;—and so do the people who make it happen. As a Junior IronCare Engineer, you’ll have the opportunity to build hands-on technical experience while supporting customers and learning from an experienced Managed Services team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4211&quot; data-end=&quot;4576&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;This is an opportunity to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4237&quot; data-end=&quot;4302&quot;&gt;learn, grow, and build a strong foundation for your IT career&lt;/strong&gt; while gaining exposure to customer support, troubleshooting, ServiceNow, documentation, and managed services operations. You’ll join a collaborative team where you can continue developing your skills, take on new challenges, and make an impact for the customers we support.&lt;/p&gt;
