&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFIT INFORMATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this position is &lt;strong&gt;$45,000-55,000/yr&lt;/strong&gt;. This range reflects the anticipated base pay for the position and is not a guarantee of final compensation. Actual compensation will be determined based on factors including experience, skills, education, location, contract requirements, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iron Bow Technologies reserves the right to fill this role at a different level, depending on qualifications and organizational priorities. This range represents only one component of Iron Bow’s total compensation package. An overview of our benefits is available on our careers page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR EQUAL OPPORTUNITY EMPLOYER COMMITMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to the principle of equal employment opportunity for all employees and to providing employees with a work environment free of discrimination and harassment.&amp;nbsp; All employment decisions at Iron Bow are based on relevant business considerations, such as operational needs, job requirements and individual qualifications, without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or gender expression, pregnancy, national origin, age, disability, status as a protected veteran or any other characteristic prohibited by law.&amp;nbsp;Iron Bow will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is for people who believe&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;trust is paramount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;transformation is embraced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;the future is here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;because&lt;strong&gt; &quot;What we do matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;!&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;We are a next generation solutions provider, delivering mission success across government, healthcare, and commercial industries. Iron Bow relies on our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;passionate people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;long standing partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to solve your most critical challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether we team with clients, colleagues, or partners, we put each other first. It’s &lt;strong&gt;The&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Iron Bow Way.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;24&quot; data-end=&quot;300&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is seeking a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;59&quot; data-end=&quot;87&quot;&gt;Junior IronCare Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing Managed Services team. In this role, you will provide frontline technical support to several key customers while helping ensure a positive customer experience throughout the support lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;You will be responsible for responding to customer requests, triaging support tickets, gathering information, performing basic troubleshooting, supporting end-user setup, and completing user moves, adds, changes, and deletes.&amp;nbsp;This is a great opportunity for someone who has a passion for technology, enjoys solving problems, and wants to build their career in IT. You’ll work in a fast-paced, customer-focused environment where strong communication, attention to detail, and a willingness to learn are essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;817&quot; data-end=&quot;903&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THIS POSITION IS FOR WEEKEND SHIFT (SAT-TUES 9-6PM)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW YOU&#39;LL MAKE AN IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;129m8v6&quot; data-start=&quot;939&quot; data-end=&quot;1057&quot;&gt;Serve as a frontline point of contact by responding to incoming customer calls and emails through the support queue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1y2fdae&quot; data-start=&quot;1058&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;Deliver a high level of customer service to both internal and external customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8m6j52&quot; data-start=&quot;1142&quot; data-end=&quot;1284&quot;&gt;Create, update, document, and close customer tickets in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt; in accordance with established ticketing and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jzzsj4&quot; data-start=&quot;1285&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;Ask effective questions, gather relevant information, and accurately document troubleshooting steps and actions taken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ljt8o&quot; data-start=&quot;1406&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;Take ownership of customer issues and escalate them through the appropriate channels when additional support is needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a4cgtv&quot; data-start=&quot;1528&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;Perform basic technical troubleshooting and information gathering to help identify and resolve customer issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mfw0z4&quot; data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1691&quot;&gt;Support user moves, adds, changes, and deletes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lasexw&quot; data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1806&quot;&gt;Assist with customer requests including information requests, password resets, and triaging call quality issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5co574&quot; data-start=&quot;1807&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;Create, maintain, and follow knowledge base documentation for customer issues and internal processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w4h077&quot; data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1994&quot;&gt;Communicate technical information clearly and effectively to non-technical users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;z8zx6i&quot; data-start=&quot;1995&quot; data-end=&quot;2083&quot;&gt;Help ensure customers remain informed and supported throughout the resolution process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;SKILLS THAT DRIVE SUCCESS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kci4oj&quot; data-start=&quot;2119&quot; data-end=&quot;2177&quot;&gt;High school diploma required; advanced degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1eitls4&quot; data-start=&quot;2178&quot; data-end=&quot;2258&quot;&gt;Demonstrated interest and aptitude in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2218&quot; data-end=&quot;2257&quot;&gt;IT, technology, and troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1da8cvi&quot; data-start=&quot;2259&quot; data-end=&quot;2340&quot;&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills with a customer-service mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t7gelp&quot; data-start=&quot;2341&quot; data-end=&quot;2446&quot;&gt;Excellent customer service skills and a strong commitment to delivering a positive customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19lvbjc&quot; data-start=&quot;2447&quot; data-end=&quot;2562&quot;&gt;Ability to ask probing questions, listen effectively, and gather the information needed to troubleshoot an issue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gdecc8&quot; data-start=&quot;2563&quot; data-end=&quot;2701&quot;&gt;Ability to remain calm, professional, and customer-focused when assisting frustrated end users who may have limited technical knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rw7v81&quot; data-start=&quot;2702&quot; data-end=&quot;2770&quot;&gt;Strong documentation, note-taking, and attention-to-detail skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mcn0ab&quot; data-start=&quot;2771&quot; data-end=&quot;2854&quot;&gt;Ability to follow established processes and execute against defined requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;185vz27&quot; data-start=&quot;2855&quot; data-end=&quot;2993&quot;&gt;Dependable and accountable, with the ability to be available and ready to support service desk calls at the start of the assigned shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qphqc6&quot; data-start=&quot;2994&quot; data-end=&quot;3042&quot;&gt;Ability to work effectively as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qtpqu6&quot; data-start=&quot;3043&quot; data-end=&quot;3116&quot;&gt;Ability to appropriately handle sensitive and confidential information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gk09l9&quot; data-start=&quot;3117&quot; data-end=&quot;3149&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3119&quot; data-end=&quot;3149&quot;&gt;U.S. citizenship required.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l2xva9&quot; data-start=&quot;3150&quot; data-end=&quot;3226&quot;&gt;Ability to obtain a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3172&quot; data-end=&quot;3225&quot;&gt;Public Trust or Secret-level government clearance&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT SETS &lt;em&gt;YOU&lt;/em&gt; APART&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
