&lt;p&gt;The PC Technician monitors and responds to requests to ensure the smooth operations of computer systems and peripherals for end-users. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW YOU&#39;LL MAKE AN IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with various support service groups to ensure proper Installation of services. Apply basic knowledge of PC/LAN communications hardware/software in a multi-protocol environment. PC Technicians log, validate and perform IMACs on the full range of products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install, configure, and maintain desktop and laptop PCs and peripherals such as printers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install, and configure application and operating system software and upgrades&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot, and repair hardware and network connectivity issues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove old equipment and performing data migration to new machines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose, log and fix VIP customer issues on a full range of applications used on customer site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;SKILLS THAT DRIVE SUCCESS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor degree or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have 3-5 years&#39; experience as a PC Technician, Systems Administrator or Help Desk Analyst&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security+CE or equivalent IAT II certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TS/SCI clearance required; minimum of TS at hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;TRAVEL REQUIREMENTS&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position does not require travel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT SETS &lt;em&gt;YOU&lt;/em&gt; APART&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years experience in Systems Administration or PC Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;WHY YOU&#39;LL LOVE IT!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iron Bow is rapidly growing and with growth comes opportunity for all.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;There is palpable energy and momentum across the company that is easy to tap into and be inspired by.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a part of organizational transformation. &amp;nbsp;Now&#39;s the time to join.&amp;nbsp; Iron Bow is redesigning the customer and employee experience.&amp;nbsp; This new approach elevates all and truly enables success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
