&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;__symantecMPKIClientDetector&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;__PRESENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR EQUAL OPPORTUNITY EMPLOYER COMMITMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to the principle of equal employment opportunity for all employees and to providing employees with a work environment free of discrimination and harassment.&amp;nbsp; All employment decisions at Iron Bow are based on relevant business considerations, such as operational needs, job requirements and individual qualifications, without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or gender expression, pregnancy, national origin, age, disability, status as a protected veteran or any other characteristic prohibited by law.&amp;nbsp;Iron Bow will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is for people who believe&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;trust is paramount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;transformation is embraced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;the future is here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;because&lt;strong&gt; &quot;What we do matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;!&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;We are a next generation solutions provider, delivering mission success across government, healthcare, and commercial industries. Iron Bow relies on our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;passionate people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;long standing partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to solve your most critical challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether we team with clients, colleagues, or partners, we put each other first. It’s &lt;strong&gt;The&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Iron Bow Way.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is seeking an accomplished Senior Director, Strategic Programs to provide strategic leadership, operational oversight, and financial stewardship for a comprehensive End User Services (EUS) Program. This highly visible position is accountable for program planning, execution, governance, and continuous improvement, ensuring service quality, operational efficiency, and measurable outcomes aligned with customer expectations, contractual commitments, and Iron Bow’s strategic objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Director will lead the annual operating plan and budget, establish program evaluation and governance practices, oversee organizational and workforce effectiveness, and ensure activities comply with customer requirements, corporate policies, applicable regulations, and professional standards. This leader will direct staffing, onboarding, performance management, and employee development while strengthening collaboration across program teams and internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A central responsibility is maintaining accurate, reliable, and actionable operational and financial information. Working with program leadership and functional partners, the Senior Director will oversee IT Service Management (ITSM) data integrity, customer records and documentation, executive reporting, program management reviews, and the controls needed to monitor service delivery and contractual performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role also carries substantial financial accountability, including oversight of expenditures, cash flow, accounting records, reporting, and timely, accurate invoicing. The successful candidate will identify and mitigate program risks, translate performance insights into corrective action, and implement improvements that enhance service delivery, strengthen the customer experience, and deliver sustainable value to Iron Bow and its customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW YOU&#39;LL MAKE AN IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Planning&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead development and execution of the EUS Program’s annual budget and operating plan, aligning resources, priorities, and performance objectives with contractual and organizational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain a program evaluation framework to assess strengths, measure results, identify gaps, and prioritize improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with program leadership and delivery teams to evaluate performance against the program mission, customer expectations, and organizational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Organization and Governance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure program activities adhere to customer requirements, established program procedures, and Iron Bow corporate policies and controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain compliance with applicable federal, state, and local regulations and relevant professional standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure program processes, decisions, and deliverables are documented and retained in an accessible, controlled central repository.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee collection, accuracy, retention, and appropriate use of customer records and program data in accordance with applicable confidentiality and privacy policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Staffing and Talent Development&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, interview, and select qualified program personnel as needed to meet delivery requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement applicable human resources policies and practices, including appropriate handling and confidentiality of personnel records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen staff performance management through clear expectations, regular feedback, coaching, and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure new employees receive effective onboarding and role-specific training, and support ongoing professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Leadership and Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and supervise program personnel, providing direction, timely feedback, and support to achieve performance objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build productive relationships with customers, internal leaders, and other stakeholders; communicate program priorities, progress, and issues effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate delivery across program activities and functional teams to improve consistency, efficiency, and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Monitoring, Financial Control, and Continuous Improvement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare accurate, timely program reports and executive briefings for internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the integrity and usefulness of information produced by the ITSM platform to support operational oversight and informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage program performance within the approved budget; monitor and approve budgeted expenditures in accordance with delegated authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review cash flow forecasts, actual cash flow, and variances on a regular, defined reporting cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee program funds, accounting records, financial reports, and supporting documentation in accordance with established policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure invoices are accurate, complete, and submitted within contractual and established timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, evaluate, and mitigate risks associated with program activities, escalating material issues as appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor delivery performance, conduct program management reviews as required, and implement corrective actions and continuous improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;SKILLS THAT DRIVE SUCCESS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least ten (10) years of IT program management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree, or five (5) additional years of management experience in lieu of a degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated knowledge of program management methodologies, governance, and performance measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management Professional (PMP) certification, or ability to obtain certification within six months of onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex contractual requirements, program budgets, financial reporting, and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead and collaborate with technical and nontechnical personnel and engage effectively with customer stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication, listening, presentation, and executive reporting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting federal, state/local/education (SLED), or commercial enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ITSM data, reporting, and service delivery performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to multiple original equipment manufacturer (OEM) ecosystems, including compute, networking, storage, security, and cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT SETS &lt;em&gt;YOU&lt;/em&gt; APART&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex end-user services or managed services programs for a systems integrator, value-added reseller (VAR), or government contractor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical and consultative skills with the ability to connect technology delivery to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of relevant competitive technology offerings and their implications for customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant OEM certifications, such as HPE Professional, Cisco Certified Specialist, or Dell Sales Portfolio certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;TRAVEL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 50%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;WHY YOU&#39;LL LOVE IT!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a mission-critical team delivering competitive, compliant, and innovative solutions for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape how Iron Bow delivers value to customers and employees through effective program leadership and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with committed professionals in a culture where people are respected, supported, and empowered to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFIT INFORMATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this position is &lt;strong&gt;$210,000-250,000/yr&lt;/strong&gt;. This range reflects the anticipated base pay for the position and is not a guarantee of final compensation. Actual compensation will be determined based on factors including experience, skills, education, location, contract requirements, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iron Bow Technologies reserves the right to fill this role at a different level, depending on qualifications and organizational priorities. This range represents only one component of Iron Bow’s total compensation package. An overview of our benefits is available on our careers page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR EQUAL OPPORTUNITY EMPLOYER COMMITMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c68&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to the principle of equal employment opportunity for all employees and to providing employees with a work environment free of discrimination and harassment.&amp;nbsp; All employment decisions at Iron Bow are based on relevant business considerations, such as operational needs, job requirements and individual qualifications, without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or gender expression, pregnancy, national origin, age, disability, status as a protected veteran or any other characteristic prohibited by law.&amp;nbsp;Iron Bow will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;Iron Bow Technologies is for people who believe&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;trust is paramount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;transformation is embraced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c77&quot;&gt;the future is here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;because&lt;strong&gt; &quot;What we do matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;!&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c76&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;We are a next generation solutions provider, delivering mission success across government, healthcare, and commercial industries. Iron Bow relies on our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;passionate people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;long standing partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;, and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c19&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to solve your most critical challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether we team with clients, colleagues, or partners, we put each other first. It’s &lt;strong&gt;The&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Iron Bow Way.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a high-impact team leading one of the largest OpenShift Virtualization migrations in the federal space. As an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;250&quot; data-end=&quot;287&quot;&gt;OpenShift Virtualization Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll help design, deploy, and operate a multi-tier Red Hat OpenShift environment while supporting the migration of approximately &lt;strong data-start=&quot;420&quot; data-end=&quot;447&quot;&gt;10,000 virtual machines&lt;/strong&gt; from VMware ESXi to OpenShift Virtualization across a large-scale, on-premises infrastructure. This role combines platform engineering, virtualization expertise, automation, and infrastructure modernization in a highly regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW YOU&#39;LL MAKE AN IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;729&quot; data-end=&quot;891&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1w0pyba&quot;&gt;Design, deploy, and support Red Hat OpenShift clusters across a hub-and-spoke architecture, including global hubs, site hubs, and distributed workload clusters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;892&quot; data-end=&quot;1071&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1kq8dgm&quot;&gt;Lead large-scale migrations of Windows and RHEL virtual machines from VMware ESXi v7/v8 to OpenShift Virtualization using the Red Hat Migration Toolkit for Virtualization (MTV).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1072&quot; data-end=&quot;1213&quot; data-section-id=&quot;eofl5z&quot;&gt;Translate VMware networking, resource pools, folders, tags, and VM configurations into OpenShift Virtualization and Kubernetes equivalents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1214&quot; data-end=&quot;1378&quot; data-section-id=&quot;nbhscz&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot migration issues, perform rollback procedures when necessary, and support migration cutovers during scheduled evening or weekend maintenance windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1379&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot; data-section-id=&quot;kx61mz&quot;&gt;Deploy and manage core OpenShift platform services including Dynatrace, NetApp Trident, Splunk, Commvault, and the OpenShift Compliance Operator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1527&quot; data-end=&quot;1661&quot; data-section-id=&quot;df0ba6&quot;&gt;Build and maintain infrastructure automation and deployment pipelines using Ansible, Git, Quay, AutoShift, and GitOps methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1662&quot; data-end=&quot;1768&quot; data-section-id=&quot;5meu70&quot;&gt;Integrate enterprise secrets management solutions such as HashiCorp Vault or CyberArk into the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1769&quot; data-end=&quot;1928&quot; data-section-id=&quot;a709wg&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot bare-metal infrastructure, including server hardware and out-of-band management platforms such as Cisco UCS/Intersight, Dell iDRAC, and HPE iLO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1929&quot; data-end=&quot;2051&quot; data-section-id=&quot;577em3&quot;&gt;Participate in Agile delivery, managing work through JIRA while following formal ServiceNow change management processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2052&quot; data-end=&quot;2206&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1601w8&quot;&gt;Maintain migration tracking and operational reporting using SharePoint Lists and support executive reporting through Power BI and other reporting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2207&quot; data-end=&quot;2328&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1b655fl&quot;&gt;Partner with infrastructure, security, and compliance teams to ensure platform accreditation and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2329&quot; data-end=&quot;2500&quot; data-section-id=&quot;op66b6&quot;&gt;Create technical documentation, migration runbooks, architecture diagrams, and operational procedures while providing technical leadership and mentoring across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c69&quot;&gt;SKILLS THAT DRIVE SUCCESS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2540&quot; data-end=&quot;3917&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2540&quot; data-end=&quot;2638&quot; data-section-id=&quot;38r9aq&quot;&gt;Experience designing, deploying, and administering Red Hat OpenShift in enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2639&quot; data-end=&quot;2776&quot; data-section-id=&quot;ka6rho&quot;&gt;Strong VMware ESXi/vSphere administration experience, including networking, resource pools, tagging, and virtualization infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2777&quot; data-end=&quot;2865&quot; data-section-id=&quot;15gkm81&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience leading or supporting enterprise-scale virtual machine migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2866&quot; data-end=&quot;3007&quot; data-section-id=&quot;3duah2&quot;&gt;Experience with Red Hat Migration Toolkit for Virtualization (MTV), OpenShift Virtualization (KubeVirt), or similar migration technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3008&quot; data-end=&quot;3113&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1hjbsac&quot;&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills across virtualization, networking, storage, and infrastructure platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3114&quot; data-end=&quot;3223&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1nes9c8&quot;&gt;Experience implementing and maintaining OpenShift Compliance Operator and compliance remediation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3224&quot; data-end=&quot;3335&quot; data-section-id=&quot;7kmlpd&quot;&gt;Proficiency with infrastructure automation using Ansible, Git, GitOps, and container registries such as Quay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3336&quot; data-end=&quot;3452&quot; data-section-id=&quot;143txs2&quot;&gt;Experience with enterprise secrets management platforms including HashiCorp Vault, CyberArk, or similar solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3453&quot; data-end=&quot;3552&quot; data-section-id=&quot;3yc4cw&quot;&gt;Experience administering or supporting bare-metal server platforms and hardware management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3553&quot; data-end=&quot;3674&quot; data-section-id=&quot;135xnyc&quot;&gt;Experience working within Agile methodologies using JIRA, ServiceNow, SharePoint, and reporting tools such as Power BI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3675&quot; data-end=&quot;3789&quot; data-section-id=&quot;f2nmcy&quot;&gt;Ability to analyze large datasets to monitor migration progress, identify risks, and communicate project status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3790&quot; data-end=&quot;3917&quot; data-section-id=&quot;u16ff1&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to collaborate across engineering, security, infrastructure, and customer teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
